  "question": {
    "text": "To increase the current sensitivity of a moving coil galvanometer by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>%</mo><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;its resistance is increased, so that new resistance becomes twice its initial resistance, by what factor does its voltage sensitivity change?",
